Choose how many batches of a known recipe to make at a crafting station. The menu shows the ingredients and the expected output before you confirm.

[b]Campaigns in 0.0.68[/b]
Gothic II: Night of the Raven without a campaign mod (German 2.6, loose GOTHIC.DAT from Steam Gold Classic, Workshop branch, build 9820952) supports the alchemy table, anvil, forge, frying pan and stove. Marcello L’Hiver DE 2.0.4 has 98 recipe profiles at nine stations. With other scripts the addon stays idle.

[b]Workshop setup[/b]
Subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2787458679]Union[/url], enable Union and this addon in the launcher, and select the original game. To play the optional campaign, also subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2847787799]Marcello L’Hiver DE[/url] and select it at launch.

If you previously installed the plugin manually, close Gothic and remove the loose [b]system/autorun/UnionBatchCraftingExtended.dll[/b] before enabling the addon.

The plugin code is MIT-licensed. [url=https://github.com/ne1800/union-batch-crafting]Browse the source code on GitHub[/url]. Steam supplies the playable addon and its licence notices.
